<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AUG A3 SMG</Major>
    <Description>Kaid's AUG A3 Recoil Script 

Just another pull down script for your favorite hobbie :) 

Feel free to mess with your attatchments as well!

SETUP

Bind macro to left mouse key. Make sure the operation mode is set to the second option.                                                                                              (HOLD UNTIL RELEASED)

FYI

Macro will not work if Keyran Drivers are not installed/activated!



GAME SETTINGS

Resolution-1920x1080

FOV-85

SenseHorizontal-13

SenseVertical-13

DPI-750

Created by HOODIExSZN
Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 0 5
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -1 5
Delay 4 ms
MoveR 0 5
Delay 4 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 4 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>